@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Terms of Service";
}

<div class="container py-5">
    <div class="max-w-800 mx-auto cc-surface-card p-5">
        <h1 class="h2 fw-bold mb-3">Terms of Service</h1>
        <p class="text-muted small mb-4">Last Updated: October 2026</p>

        <h5 class="fw-bold mt-4">1. Informational Purpose Only</h5>
        <p class="text-muted small">
            CardCompass provides credit card comparisons, reward valuations, and recommendation simulations strictly for educational and informational purposes. CardCompass is not a bank, non-banking financial company (NBFC), or financial advisor.
        </p>

        <h5 class="fw-bold mt-4">2. Bank Decisions & Approval Authority</h5>
        <p class="text-muted small">
            All credit card applications, eligibility determinations, credit scores, credit limits, interest rates, and fee waivers are determined exclusively by the respective issuing banks. CardCompass match scores represent calculated mathematical alignment with published criteria and do not constitute a guarantee of approval.
        </p>

        <h5 class="fw-bold mt-4">3. Data Accuracy & Updates</h5>
        <p class="text-muted small">
            Banks frequently modify reward rates, airport lounge tie-ups, monthly caps, and fee structures. While we strive to maintain our 30-card dataset with verified citations, users should always cross-reference the official bank Most Important Terms and Conditions (MITC) before applying.
        </p>

        <h5 class="fw-bold mt-4">4. Responsible Credit Usage</h5>
        <p class="text-muted small">
            Credit cards can carry high annual percentage rates (APR) of 36% to 45% p.a. on unpaid balances. Users should never incur debt or spend beyond their means simply to earn reward points.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>
